docs {
  # DocumentsService.SignVersion

  The viewer signs a pending version as the staff member of their email

  `/ltedu.documents.v1.DocumentsService/SignVersion` · unary · `ltedu/documents/v1/documents.proto`

  ## Request — `SignVersionRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `version_id` | `string` |  |

  ## Response — `SignVersionResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `version` | `DocumentVersion` |  |
  | `published` | `bool` |  |

